<title>USA: Coach USA applies for NYSE listing.</title>
<headline>Coach USA applies for NYSE listing.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coach USA Inc said it filed to list its common stock on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Following final approval of the application by the NYSE, Coach said it expects to begin trading on the Big Board in early May, 1997.</p>
<p>The company did not release a proposed new symbol on the NYSE.</p>
</text>
